  "changes": [
    "Deduplicate cumulative stream usage by actual message ID.",
    "Partial receipts remain incomplete in original budgets and personal activity.",
    "Preserve explicit incomplete status when adopting a native decision into Work.",
    "Only successful terminal receipt plus actual process exit completes the external invocation."
